      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes and you could even use it to make characters more interactive and to have things such as multi-phase idle animations, jump animations with starts and ends, replace/expand upon gestures, edit character movement animations easier, etc etc... however they will still need to add a parameter for sitting so you can change/add the sitting animation",
